# 未来我 backend — copy to .env if you need to override server settings.
# API keys are NOT configured here anymore: open the web admin console
# (http://<host>:6999/admin) after first boot and fill them in there.
# Keys live in the SQLite settings table, never in env vars.
#
# Server settings only (all optional):
# HOST=0.0.0.0
# PORT=6999
# DATA_DIR=./data
#
# Legacy only: JWT_SECRET overrides the auto-generated device-token signing
# secret. New installs should NOT set it — the secret is generated into the
# settings table on first boot.
# JWT_SECRET=
